--- text
Your account is locked

The [PRODUCT_NAME] account registered to [EMAIL_ADDRESS] was locked
at [EVENT_TIME]. We lock an account when the activity on it does
not match the person who owns it. Nothing in the account has been
changed or deleted.

To use the account again, verify that it is you. That clears the
lock.

Details of the lock

Account: [EMAIL_ADDRESS]
When: [EVENT_TIME]
Reason: [LOCK_REASON]

Unlock your account:

[CTA_URL]

This link expires at [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE] - [EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after it
was sent.

If this was not you, someone else may be trying to get into your
account. Unlock the account, then change your password to one you
have not used anywhere else.

Important: [COMPANY_NAME] will never ask you for your password or
for a code to unlock an account. If someone asks you for either,
they are not us.

If you cannot get back in, reply to this email, or write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
